    <description>ALF-RS-09 (LFRDN-339) FR2/AC1/AC2/FR3/FR5: after any Payment is saved with an Opportunity set, recomputes that Opportunity&apos;s Invoice Summary paid amount, balance, and status (Unpaid/Partially Paid/Fully Paid) via AF_InvoiceSummary_Recalculate (delegates to AF_InvoiceSummaryService.recalculateForOpportunities - the same dual-path AF_Status__c = Paid / Verified OR AF_IntegrationStatus__c = Synced verification rule AF_ReservationContractService already uses for FR12), generates the Sales Transaction Summary on the Opportunity&apos;s first verified payment (AF_TxnSummary_GenerateOnFirstPay), then regenerates the reservation contract if one already exists so it keeps reflecting the current deposit/balance (AF_ReservationContract_Regen) - BRD FR3/AC1 require the contract to reflect the deposit &quot;when the payment is recorded&quot;, not only at first generation.</description>
    <environments>Default</environments>
